<title>POLAND: Bank Slaski Q1 net falls to PLN 47.5 mln.</title>
<headline>Bank Slaski Q1 net falls to PLN 47.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Slaski preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997     Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			84.54  vs  145.63</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  84.53  vs  145.63</p>
<p>    net profit				47.48  vs  103.33</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Bank Slaski SA.</p>
<p>    revenues from securities	     0.00  vs    0.00</p>
<p>    interest and similar revenues    359.50  vs  342.02</p>
<p>    interest and similar costs	 203.82  vs  178.27</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    revenues from commission	    58.34  vs   51.79</p>
<p>    costs of commission		    1.09  vs    0.85</p>
<p>    income tax				37.05  vs   42.30</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00  vs    0.00</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		     0.01  vs    0.00</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
